 / B Button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera control: Mouse / Right Stick</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use item: E / R Shoulder</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save function: Available</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming Guidelines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regarding streaming and let's play videos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No prior contact is necessary for streaming or creating/posting gameplay videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to create content regardless of monetization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precautions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refrain from defaming or making aggressive comments toward others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please be respectful toward the game content and other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Note</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Niji Voice&quot; is used for character voices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A walking simulator about a journey in search of the mother ocean. Control &quot;Hoi-chan,&quot; a girl with a yellow hat, and collect hearts hidden throughout various locations.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644800/cfb0d85be3dac16645103f1fbf8243bb8c073877/header.jpg?t=1747660311", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644800/6d4c75e6e71a6fae0f00d19de428951a6e5eefbd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747660311", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644800/6d4c75e6e71a6fae0f00d19de428951a6e5eefbd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747660311", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 / 11 (64bi